            <ArticleTitle>Guideline statements on the management of procedure-related pain in neonates, children and adolescents.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>14-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This annotation discusses the process of writing guidelines on procedure-related pain management by a diverse group of paediatricians and a consumer. It examines possible reasons for the huge gap between evidence and clinical practice and recommends that all health professionals look at their own experiences of pain growing up.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
